{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块保留了处境、原因和反应之间的关系，单看大字更容易明白每屏发生了什么；small：平，Y 的旁注更有针对性，但部分感受与话语重复，X 较精简却也有少数偏向音乐描写。core：平，两版都贯穿了不愿再忍受委屈与怀念旧日亲近、归属之间的拉扯，也都以带着想念继续生活收束；concise：X 略好，Y 的 S07、S10 等屏有多处对孤单、失衡和无答案的重复表达。human：X 更自然，Y 有“舞曲带着众人的庄严”“不停往前赶，只为躲开停下来”“心脏以最高负荷剧烈跳动”等具体生硬的搭配；fine：X 更有辨识度，“外头像给众人看的舞步，心里却只哼自己的旧歌”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”等表达比 Y 部分较泛化的情绪描写更具体；load：X 更轻，Y 的整段话都成为大块，S10、S11、S12 等屏幕在较短停留时间内累积了多条较长文字。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f164961-b748-4c0e-82eb-b0fd917c6f7d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T041621465506Z", "elapsed_seconds": 254.968, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:20:36.446609+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "83273ec68d9d7360613b8de18691ca2bc7ad18ac228fba94404469c8863fd743", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae